  "title": "Engine shut down after take-off; overweight landing back at base",
  "narrative": "South of London Gatwick, 11:18Z. On Accent Air ACX509 to Rome, an A321 (AX-ENG) with 212 passengers, engine 1 oil pressure drops on the climb and the crew shut the engine down. The commander returns to Gatwick and will land overweight. Fire cover must be in position, engineers must meet the aircraft, and an evening Geneva return depends on this aircraft. The commander flies and decides the aircraft; the agents prepare the ground.",
